	(text "ROTOR IV wiring card (W).  Passive: the outbound half is the rotor, the return half is its inverse.\nW[A..Z] = ESOVPZJAYQUIRHXLNFTGKDCMWB\nOutbound  J3 pin i+1  ->  J1 pin W[i]+1     (net OW_<in><out>)\nReturn    J4 pin j+1  ->  J2 pin Winv[j]+1  (net RW_<in><out>), Winv = HZWVARTNLGUPXQCEJMBSKDYOIF\nStack (layout.md 3.2, card faces back): bottom edge = IN (J3 outbound, J4 return), top edge = OUT (J1 outbound, J2 return).\nConnector names follow the shifter's J1..J4 positions, not the signal direction.  See README.md section 2."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 20 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9773ecce-6126-55e0-9ad8-061e9b8609ed")
	)
